{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backpack Jianghu is now open for free DEMO! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring four major sects\u2014Huashan, Shaolin, Wudang, and Wudu\u201412 sub-classes, 10 talent skills, and nearly 200 items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack jianghu\u00a0</strong>is a inventory management and battle royale game. Choose a starting sect, enter the world with dozens of players, pick your path, battle and grow, and compete in the final showdown at Mount Hua's peak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/9b0e576530b67ba000a16e914c436187.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Backpack Battles</i>, but with big innovations. Use inner energy to boost skills, upgrade weapons, combine low-tier skills into high-tier ones, and use skill fragments to permanently level up abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with 200+ items. Make overpowered builds like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lonely Nine Swords</strong> \u2013 attack 20 times in a row, each hit applying armor break and bleed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taichi Mastery</strong> \u2013 counter-attack automatically when hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Strike</strong> \u2013 deal 99,999 damage in one blow, ignoring armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qiankun Dodge</strong> \u2013 evade and reflect the next attack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strategy has a counter. The possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/dfcc0015326bca013842b11cf994680d.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/f701b29c6d1cad03768d14c5286f67e5.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share the world with 99 others. Pick your path: fight, shop, find chests, rest, or risk random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Other players are saved data, not live people. Take your time to manage your pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/1baf4147dd634387e3211d0023390070.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But always remember: your goal is to reach Mount Hua\u2019s peak and defeat everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/4ae649913b2d20636faf7f04b6038c52.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/61be43dba98816a05f39ca50c6e8bdc4.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/f70323aea71893ec412af8fd00382a3c.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, you can spy on enemy packs. See what items they carry. Learn their strategy and what loot they\u2019ll drop if defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/13d63a892b1980fb223d48076a571821.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and when you beat someone, you loot some items from their pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/fe5baccd11046d8e698173df4748f455.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/3bc8db7bf25c9a7e4f0b958eab2cd91a.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sect starts with a different pack, items, and location. The shops, chests, events, and enemies you meet also change based on your sect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned sects (may change):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shaolin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wudang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huashan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wudu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xuedao</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaibang</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xuanji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changsheng</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emei</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liushanmen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiayao</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(This is just an example; the exact quantity and order will be subject to the official release.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/e2682b1cb2d07baf0caf2962e299efdb.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/100dce74b9251a858b541ab2e772c956.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a game, share your lineup\u00a0code to Discord and social media platforms to directly battle against other players' best teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/c356c9176b9691f69f63c29e72b84f61.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972650?t=1769060114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/2ee34c01f3617a871d68e7f002f2cee59670f660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769060114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/d9cd1e90dba8de4cccabfbcda9582543f1e1dc2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769060114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/d9cd1e90dba8de4cccabfbcda9582543f1e1dc2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769060114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4074210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backpack Jianghu is now open for free DEMO! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring four major sects\u2014Huashan, Shaolin, Wudang, and Wudu\u201412 sub-classes, 10 talent skills, and nearly 200 items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack jianghu\u00a0</strong>is a inventory management and battle royale game. Choose a starting sect, enter the world with dozens of players, pick your path, battle and grow, and compete in the final showdown at Mount Hua's peak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/9b0e576530b67ba000a16e914c436187.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Backpack Battles</i>, but with big innovations. Use inner energy to boost skills, upgrade weapons, combine low-tier skills into high-tier ones, and use skill fragments to permanently level up abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with 200+ items. Make overpowered builds like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lonely Nine Swords</strong> \u2013 attack 20 times in a row, each hit applying armor break and bleed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taichi Mastery</strong> \u2013 counter-attack automatically when hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Strike</strong> \u2013 deal 99,999 damage in one blow, ignoring armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qiankun Dodge</strong> \u2013 evade and reflect the next attack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strategy has a counter. The possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/dfcc0015326bca013842b11cf994680d.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/f701b29c6d1cad03768d14c5286f67e5.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You share the world with 99 others. Pick your path: fight, shop, find chests, rest, or risk random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Other players are saved data, not live people. Take your time to manage your pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/1baf4147dd634387e3211d0023390070.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But always remember: your goal is to reach Mount Hua\u2019s peak and defeat everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/4ae649913b2d20636faf7f04b6038c52.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/61be43dba98816a05f39ca50c6e8bdc4.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/f70323aea71893ec412af8fd00382a3c.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the map, you can spy on enemy packs. See what items they carry. Learn their strategy and what loot they\u2019ll drop if defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/13d63a892b1980fb223d48076a571821.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and when you beat someone, you loot some items from their pack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972650/extras/fe5baccd11046d8e698173df4748f455.avif?t=1769060114\" width=1560 height=8